OL,3,GNEWSA'No route to funding' for closed
OL,4,Apool - council
OL,5,
OL,6,FMillions of pounds allocated to a
OL,7,Fcancelled leisure centre project cannot
OL,8,Fbe committed to reopen a closed
OL,9,Fswimming pool, a council has said.
OL,11,FThe Reform UK-led Bradford Council said
OL,12,Fit could not pledge to spend #14.6m of
OL,13,FLevelling Up money - which it received
OL,14,Ffor the cancelled Squire Lane Leisure
OL,15,FCentre - on other projects.
OL,17,FCampaigners had urged the authority to
OL,18,Fuse some of the government money to
OL,19,Fbring back Bingley Pool, which is
OL,20,Festimated to cost #8.6m.
OL,23,APub: 17-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
