OL,3,GNEWSA'No route to funding' for closed
OL,4,Apool - council
OL,5,
OL,6,FBradford Council leader Stephen Place
OL,7,Fsaid it had paused the sale of Bingley
OL,8,FPool but the facility had "no role in
OL,9,Fthe council's future sport and leisure
OL,10,Fstrategy", with "no proposal to spend
OL,11,Fadditional budget on it".
